Re: Lock Repair Request — Flat 23, 155 Willowmere Road, Alderwick, ZZ5 2ZZ (tenant contact as per our appointment email of 17/11/2024).

We have no work result or invoice on file for this job. Please reply by close of business on the second working day from today with, quoting this job ID and this address:
1. Confirmation of whether the front door lock at Flat 23, 155 Willowmere Road was repaired or replaced, and the date of attendance;
2. What was fitted (parts/labour) and any photos;
3. Your invoice, itemised with VAT, for this address only — please invoice other addresses separately.

If we do not hear from you by then we will treat the job as unverified and refer it to the property manager before any payment is approved.
